---
import Full from '../layouts/Full.astro';
---

<Full
	title="Avior Studio — Small worlds. Useful tools."
	description="Independent games, a terminal arcade, and developer tools built from the work of making them. Explore Fields of Revik, Castle Drop, Prizm, GDAM and gdlint."
>
	<main id="main-content">
		<section class="cover">
			<div class="cover-copy">
				<p class="eyebrow">INDEPENDENT GAMES & DEVELOPER TOOLS</p>
				<h1>
					Small worlds.
					<br />
					<em>Big possibilities.</em>
				</h1>
				<p>
					Games worth getting lost in.
					<br />
					Tools that help us get there.
				</p>
				<a class="studio-button" href="/games">
					Explore our worlds <span>↗</span>
				</a>
				<span class="cover-index">AVIOR STUDIO / SELECTED WORK</span>
			</div>
			<a class="cover-art" href="https://app.revik.gg" aria-label="Play Fields of Revik">
				<img
					src="/art/revik-title.png"
					alt="A fox knight overlooking the colourful hex-tile valley of Fields of Revik"
					width="1024"
					height="1536"
					fetchpriority="high"
				/>
				<div class="art-label">
					<span>FIELDS OF REVIK</span>
					<span>Enter the valley ↗</span>
				</div>
			</a>
		</section>
		<section class="work">
			<div class="section-line">
				<h2>Worlds in the making</h2>
				<a href="/games">All games ↗</a>
			</div>
			<div class="game-grid">
				<a class="game-art castle" href="/games#castle-drop">
					<div class="castle-scene">
						<img class="far" src="/art/hills-far.svg" alt="" />
						<img class="near" src="/art/hills-near.svg" alt="" />
						<img class="dragon" src="/art/dragon.svg" alt="Castle Drop's red dragon" />
						<img class="goblin" src="/art/goblin.svg" alt="" />
						<img class="game-logo" src="/art/castledrop-logo.png" alt="Castle Drop" />
					</div>
					<div class="game-caption">
						<div>
							<h3>Castle Drop</h3>
							<p>Grab. Throw. Defend your castle.</p>
						</div>
						<span>PROTOTYPE ↗</span>
					</div>
				</a>
				<a class="game-art prizm" href="/games#prizm">
					<div class="prizm-scene">
						<span class="beam one"></span>
						<span class="beam two"></span>
						<img class="crystal" src="/art/crystal.svg" alt="Prizm's faceted purple crystal" />
						<img class="game-logo" src="/art/prizm-logo.png" alt="Prizm" />
					</div>
					<div class="game-caption">
						<div>
							<h3>Prizm</h3>
							<p>A little light. A new way through.</p>
						</div>
						<span>PROTOTYPE ↗</span>
					</div>
				</a>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="arcade-strip">
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow">PLAY SOMETHING RIGHT NOW</p>
				<h2>
					An arcade.
					<br />
					In your terminal.
				</h2>
				<p>Asteroid, Tetris and Brickough. A small collection of classics, rendered in the place you already work.</p>
				<a class="studio-button" href="https://www.termca.de">
					Meet termcade ↗
				</a>
			</div>
			<div class="pixel-art" aria-hidden="true">
				<span>▟▙</span>
				<b>▐▛▀▜▌</b>
				<span>▝▘ ▝▘</span>
				<small>INSERT COMMAND</small>
				<code>go run github.com/aviorstudio/termcade@latest</code>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="tool-story">
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow">FROM THE WORKBENCH</p>
				<h2>
					Better tools.
					<br />
					<em>More time to play.</em>
				</h2>
				<p>
					The games share more than a studio. Their addons, script checks and vector artwork grow from the same
					workbench.
				</p>
				<a href="/devtools">Explore the devtools ↗</a>
			</div>
			<div class="tool-links">
				<a href="https://gdam.dev">
					<span>01</span>
					<div>
						<h3>GDAM</h3>
						<p>Godot addons. Installed and pinned.</p>
					</div>
					<b>↗</b>
				</a>
				<a href="https://gdlint.dev">
					<span>02</span>
					<div>
						<h3>gdlint</h3>
						<p>Keep the GDScript tidy.</p>
					</div>
					<b>↗</b>
				</a>
				<div class="tool-note">
					<span>03</span>
					<div>
						<h3>Spritesmith</h3>
						<p>
							Vector-authored game art, from Python to the screen. The dragon and crystals above come straight from the
							games.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Full>
<style>
	.cover {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		min-height: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto 90px;
		max-width: 1440px;
		background: #e9e7dc;
	}
	.cover-copy {
		padding: 85px max(32px, calc((100vw - 1180px) / 2));
		padding-right: 35px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: start;
	}
	.cover h1 {
		font-size: clamp(54px, 5.6vw, 84px);
		line-height: 1.02;
		letter-spacing: -0.06em;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin: 36px 0 24px;
	}
	.cover h1 em {
		font-family: Georgia, serif;
		font-weight: 400;
		color: #536048;
	}
	.cover-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) {
		font-size: 20px;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #586052;
	}
	.cover-index {
		margin-top: auto;
		padding-top: 65px;
		font: 10px var(--mono);
		letter-spacing: 0.15em;
	}
	.cover-art {
		position: relative;
		display: block;
		overflow: hidden;
	}
	.cover-art > img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		position: absolute;
		transition: transform 0.6s;
	}
	.cover-art:hover > img {
		transform: scale(1.025);
	}
	.art-label {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 24px;
		left: 24px;
		right: 24px;
		background: #183026e8;
		color: #fff;
		padding: 20px;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 16px;
		font: 11px var(--mono);
	}
	.studio-button {
		display: inline-flex;
		gap: 35px;
		background: #24392b;
		color: #fff;
		padding: 18px 24px;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 13px;
		border-radius: 2px;
	}
	.studio-button:hover {
		background: #42633d;
	}
	.work,
	.tool-story,
	.arcade-strip {
		width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 64px));
		margin: 0 auto 90px;
	}
	.section-line {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		margin-bottom: 25px;
	}
	.section-line h2 {
		font-size: 25px;
		font-weight: 500;
		margin: 0;
	}
	.section-line a,
	.tool-story a {
		color: inherit;
		font-size: 13px;
		text-underline-offset: 5px;
	}
	.game-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 26px;
	}
	.game-art {
		color: inherit;
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.castle-scene,
	.prizm-scene {
		height: 380px;
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
	}
	.castle-scene {
		background: linear-gradient(#bddeea, #e7ecd9);
	}
	.castle-scene .far,
	.castle-scene .near {
		position: absolute;
		width: 100%;
		bottom: 0;
		height: 40%;
		object-fit: fill;
	}
	.castle-scene .far {
		bottom: 12%;
		opacity: 0.7;
	}
	.dragon {
		position: absolute;
		width: 70%;
		bottom: 12%;
		left: 20%;
		filter: drop-shadow(0 15px 15px #293f3930);
		transition: transform 0.4s;
	}
	.goblin {
		position: absolute;
		width: 23%;
		bottom: -2%;
		left: 4%;
	}
	.game-logo {
		position: absolute;
		width: 45%;
		top: 20px;
		left: 20px;
	}
	.game-art:hover .dragon {
		transform: translateY(-8px) rotate(-2deg);
	}
	.prizm-scene {
		background-color: #222837;
		background-image:
			linear-gradient(#9dacc415 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, #9dacc415 1px, transparent 1px);
		background-size: 48px 48px;
	}
	.prizm-scene .crystal {
		position: absolute;
		width: 65%;
		right: -2%;
		bottom: -2%;
		filter: drop-shadow(0 0 30px #aa66ff40);
	}
	.prizm-scene .game-logo {
		width: 46%;
		top: 24px;
	}
	.beam {
		position: absolute;
		background: #cb77ff;
		box-shadow: 0 0 18px #d278ff;
		width: 60%;
		height: 3px;
		top: 68%;
		left: -10%;
		transform: rotate(-20deg);
	}
	.beam.two {
		left: 58%;
		top: 33%;
		width: 55%;
		transform: rotate(-62deg);
	}
	.game-caption {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 22px 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd0c3;
		gap: 12px;
	}
	.game-caption h3 {
		font-size: 21px;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin: 0 0 7px;
	}
	.game-caption p {
		font-size: 13px;
		color: #596452;
		margin: 0;
	}
	.game-caption > span {
		font: 9px var(--mono);
		white-space: nowrap;
	}
	.arcade-strip {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		background: #192622;
		color: #eff3dd;
		padding: 55px;
		gap: 40px;
	}
	.arcade-strip h2 {
		font-size: 48px;
		letter-spacing: -0.05em;
		line-height: 1.1;
		margin: 20px 0;
	}
	.arcade-strip p:not(.eyebrow) {
		max-width: 420px;
		color: #b3c0ad;
		line-height: 1.7;
		font-size: 15px;
	}
	.arcade-strip .studio-button {
		background: #d1df8c;
		color: #1c2b21;
	}
	.pixel-art {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		font: 70px/1 var(--mono);
		color: #d1df8c;
		text-align: center;
	}
	.pixel-art b {
		font-weight: 400;
	}
	.pixel-art small {
		font: 10px var(--mono);
		letter-spacing: 0.3em;
		margin-top: 30px;
	}
	.pixel-art code {
		font: 11px/1.6 var(--mono);
		margin-top: 15px;
		overflow-wrap: anywhere;
	}
	.tool-story {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 90px;
		padding: 20px 0 40px;
	}
	.tool-story h2 {
		font-size: 48px;
		line-height: 1.1;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
		font-weight: 500;
		margin: 24px 0;
	}
	.tool-story h2 em {
		font-family: Georgia, serif;
		color: #536048;
	}
	.tool-story p {
		font-size: 15px;
		line-height: 1.7;
		max-width: 440px;
		color: #596452;
	}
	.tool-links > a,
	.tool-note {
		display: flex;
		align-items: start;
		gap: 25px;
		padding: 28px 0;
		border-top: 1px solid #cbd0c3;
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.tool-links span {
		font: 10px var(--mono);
		margin-top: 5px;
		color: #65705f;
	}
	.tool-links h3 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 25px;
		font-weight: 550;
	}
	.tool-links p {
		margin: 7px 0 0;
		font-size: 13px;
	}
	.tool-links b {
		margin-left: auto;
	}
	.eyebrow {
		font: 10px var(--mono);
		letter-spacing: 0.14em;
	}
	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.cover-copy {
			padding: 60px 32px;
		}
		.cover {
			min-height: 620px;
		}
		.cover h1 {
			font-size: 58px;
		}
		.tool-story {
			gap: 40px;
		}
		.castle-scene,
		.prizm-scene {
			height: 300px;
		}
		.arcade-strip {
			padding: 35px;
		}
		.pixel-art {
			font-size: 50px;
		}
	}
	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.cover {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			margin-bottom: 50px;
		}
		.cover-copy {
			padding: 45px 24px;
		}
		.cover h1 {
			font-size: 52px;
		}
		.cover-copy > p:not(.eyebrow) {
			font-size: 17px;
		}
		.cover-index {
			padding-top: 30px;
		}
		.cover-art {
			height: 470px;
		}
		.cover-art > img {
			object-position: center 60%;
		}
		.work,
		.tool-story,
		.arcade-strip {
			width: calc(100% - 40px);
			margin-bottom: 55px;
		}
		.game-grid,
		.tool-story,
		.arcade-strip {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
		.castle-scene,
		.prizm-scene {
			height: 300px;
		}
		.section-line h2 {
			font-size: 21px;
		}
		.section-line a {
			font-size: 11px;
		}
		.arcade-strip {
			padding: 30px 24px;
			gap: 35px;
		}
		.arcade-strip h2,
		.tool-story h2 {
			font-size: 40px;
		}
		.pixel-art {
			padding: 20px 0;
		}
		.game-caption > span {
			font-size: 8px;
		}
		.game-caption p {
			font-size: 12px;
		}
		.tool-story {
			gap: 30px;
		}
	}
</style>
